WEBVTT

00:01:36.230 --> 00:01:38.760
With relief, we finally made it to
the temple of the Fire Dragon King...

00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:41.060
...although we knocked down a
big chunk of it in the process.

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:44.040
Well, we did accept
responsibility for doing that.

00:01:44.110 --> 00:01:47.740
And with my help, we naturally
fixed it up in no time.

00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:51.270
But don't tell me they called
us out here just to do THIS!

00:01:51.350 --> 00:01:55.040
We're supposed to save the world from
some prophecized destruction!

00:01:55.250 --> 00:01:57.310
So! Hey, Old Man Dragon!

00:01:57.390 --> 00:02:00.950
Maybe you should be a
little nicer about asking us!

00:02:01.160 --> 00:02:04.990
And then who should suddenly appear?
Who the heck IS this guy?!

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:21.940
The guy from before...

00:02:37.060 --> 00:02:37.960
Who are you?!

00:02:38.390 --> 00:02:42.350
My name is Almayce.
I have come from the Overworld.

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:44.060
The Overworld?

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:44.790
Overworld?

00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:47.530
Don't you DARE!

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:49.330
What did I do?!

00:02:49.410 --> 00:02:51.600
I know what you do when
you hear new words!

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:53.730
Overworld means a world
on a plane above this one!

00:02:53.810 --> 00:02:56.010
As in he comes from
a different world than here!

00:02:57.050 --> 00:02:58.450
I understand...

00:03:00.120 --> 00:03:02.280
Someone from the Overworld...

00:03:10.630 --> 00:03:16.620
<i>Why must I do nothing when
Lina Inverse is right in front of me?!</i>

00:03:20.140 --> 00:03:22.000
I'll never forget...

00:03:23.070 --> 00:03:27.700
The unforgivable sin of those who
allied themselves with the Gods!

00:03:49.070 --> 00:03:53.260
Is this how the
allies of the Gods act?!

00:04:28.170 --> 00:04:31.570
You're a mess. Well? Answer me.

00:04:31.640 --> 00:04:34.940
And now a Monster comes
to kill me, is that it?

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:52.790
Damn you, Almayce...

00:04:54.300 --> 00:04:55.820
You come from the Overworld?

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:59.340
And why have you
come to this world?

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:02.030
Why have you entered this temple?

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:06.330
We seek five weapons
of power for our world.

00:05:06.680 --> 00:05:08.640
I have come for one of them...

00:05:08.710 --> 00:05:11.980
...the sword Gorun Nova,
which this man possesses.

00:05:12.280 --> 00:05:14.910
Like hell! The Sword
of Light is mine...

00:05:15.490 --> 00:05:18.780
It belongs to me!
I'm letting Gourry use it, though.

00:05:18.860 --> 00:05:21.980
No, it's not! This sword
definitely belongs to ME!

00:05:22.060 --> 00:05:22.890
I deny that.

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:24.120
Now look!

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:29.500
And what do you wish to do with
the Sword of Light, Overworlder?

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:31.530
Why do you ask me that?

00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:34.460
If we give you the Sword of Light...

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:37.230
...and you leave at once,
there is no problem!

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:41.970
H- Hold it! You can't just offer
to give my Sword of Light away!

00:05:42.050 --> 00:05:43.980
It's MI NE, I said!

00:05:44.050 --> 00:05:47.450
What we desire is
to protect this world.

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:51.750
For that, we will even
sacrifice the Sword of Light.

00:05:51.820 --> 00:05:56.880
Now, Overworlder, what will you
do with the Sword of Light?

00:05:57.260 --> 00:05:59.690
I shall tell you, then.

00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:04.960
What I desire is to summon the
Dark Lord Darkstar to this world.

00:06:05.070 --> 00:06:05.860
You what?!

00:06:11.110 --> 00:06:12.200
What?!

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:15.040
Summon Darkstar to this world?!

00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:17.810
<i>Darkstar...</i>

00:06:18.680 --> 00:06:21.080
<i>A dark lord of the
Overworld who is the equal...</i>

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:24.680
<i>... of the Dark Lord
Shabranigdo of this world.</i>

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:27.410
You've got to be kidding!

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:32.050
Why do you have to summon a
guy like that to our world?!

00:06:32.130 --> 00:06:35.260
<i>Darkstar... Could that mean?!</i>

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:40.930
The "dark star" mentioned in
the prophecy of destruction?!

00:06:41.740 --> 00:06:46.770
You probably want to take over
this world using Darkstar's power!

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:50.440
In the name ofJustice, I,
Amelia, shall never allow it!

00:06:50.810 --> 00:06:54.410
My objective is
not world domination.

00:06:54.620 --> 00:06:59.350
Overworlder! I don't know what you
seek to gain by summoning Darkstar...

00:06:59.760 --> 00:07:03.750
...but can't you do it in a
place outside of this world?

00:07:04.290 --> 00:07:05.260
What?

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:06.820
What's he mean?

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:15.100
When Almayce came to this place,
he led me to the one I seek!

00:07:19.210 --> 00:07:24.770
If you are speaking the truth and
this world is not your objective...

00:07:24.850 --> 00:07:30.110
...then we will give you the Sword of
Light if you then leave this world.

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:32.180
Wh- What?!

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:33.850
Elder!

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:38.450
If we fight here, I imagine
both sides will suffer.

00:07:38.530 --> 00:07:41.900
If we should lose and the
Sword of Light is stolen...

00:07:41.960 --> 00:07:44.300
...then Darkstar will be
summoned to this world.

00:07:44.370 --> 00:07:46.840
And that must not
be allowed to happen!

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:48.160
Wait a minute!

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:51.300
Are you saying you don't care
about him summoning Darkstar...

00:07:51.370 --> 00:07:53.370
...as long as he does
it on another world?!

00:07:53.440 --> 00:07:55.270
Elder, you can't mean that!

00:07:55.340 --> 00:07:56.370
Silence, Filia!

00:07:56.810 --> 00:08:02.910
That wouldn't be just! Is this how
servants of the Gods do things?!

00:08:03.050 --> 00:08:04.880
What do you say, Overworlder?

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:11.020
You of this world are not so
different from us, are you?

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:12.560
What does that mean?

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:16.260
I, too, do not desire
a useless struggle.

00:08:16.670 --> 00:08:19.330
I'll accept your proposal.

00:08:19.400 --> 00:08:22.130
Are you sure of
what you're saying?

00:08:22.210 --> 00:08:25.040
Once I possess Gorun Nova
and one other weapon...

00:08:25.110 --> 00:08:27.510
...I shall have no further
need of this world.

00:08:27.580 --> 00:08:31.640
I promise not to summon
Darkstar to this world.

00:08:31.850 --> 00:08:35.910
Understood. And we will assist
you in finding the other weapon.

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:40.510
Once you have it, you must
leave this world at once!

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:42.110
Now, wait just a
darned minute here!

00:08:42.190 --> 00:08:45.320
Quit speaking for us,
especially when we don't agree!

00:08:45.390 --> 00:08:50.130
We must prevent any disaster
from coming to this world!

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:53.070
Now, give him the Sword of Light!

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:54.070
Like hell I will!

00:08:54.140 --> 00:08:56.070
Yeah! No matter
how sad his story is...

00:08:56.140 --> 00:08:58.870
...there's no way we're gonna
just give that away for free!

00:08:58.940 --> 00:09:01.710
The merchant's blood in me
would never allow that!

00:09:02.110 --> 00:09:04.240
If you refuse, then you
leave us no choice...

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:07.250
Wait, please! Elder!

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:08.580
Stand aside, Filia!

00:09:09.090 --> 00:09:12.020
This is our only choice
for saving this world!

00:09:12.720 --> 00:09:18.060
"Anna-gurax... ozu-lu-faam...
izul nax orumudohl..."

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:19.420
What's that language?

00:09:19.900 --> 00:09:21.830
A holy spell. He wouldn't!

00:09:22.300 --> 00:09:24.130
RAY FREEZE!

00:09:29.770 --> 00:09:30.830
My body!

00:09:31.310 --> 00:09:32.430
Elder!

00:09:32.510 --> 00:09:35.270
Now, then, I shall take
the Sword of Light.

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:39.610
You son of a! Is this how
the Dragon race does things?!

00:09:40.320 --> 00:09:44.550
This is what we do
to save our world.

00:09:58.000 --> 00:10:00.300
So, has Lord Gaav,
the Demon Dragon King...

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:03.240
...come to see
my miserable death?

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:08.310
In the end, there is no
difference between God and Monster...

00:10:16.680 --> 00:10:21.420
You're finished, young
Val of the Ancient Dragons.

00:10:21.490 --> 00:10:23.620
Are you afraid?
That you're dying now?

00:10:24.960 --> 00:10:26.890
What does it matter?

00:10:27.260 --> 00:10:29.490
Heh... Just like me.

00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:31.100
What?

00:10:31.170 --> 00:10:33.500
I'm on the run from
the Monster race now.

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:35.970
You're like me, in a way.

00:10:39.640 --> 00:10:43.200
It just seems a shame that you're
in such similar circumstances.

00:10:43.510 --> 00:10:44.670
A shame?

00:10:44.750 --> 00:10:47.580
How about it? Won't you
join forces with me?

00:10:47.650 --> 00:10:50.450
Join forces with you?
For what?

00:10:50.520 --> 00:10:53.920
Good question. For now,
how about for survival?

00:10:54.390 --> 00:10:56.910
Heh... Sounds pretty weak to me.

00:10:56.990 --> 00:11:01.490
Not at all. It's just the
thing to really infuriate...

00:11:01.560 --> 00:11:04.900
...the ones who
want to kill us, right?

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:08.440
I suppose so.

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:09.600
But... it's too late now.

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:12.540
Hardly. There's one option.

00:11:12.610 --> 00:11:16.240
You die and be
reborn as a Monster.

00:11:16.310 --> 00:11:18.800
As my retainer.

00:11:19.110 --> 00:11:22.010
I see... That won't be so bad...

00:11:26.590 --> 00:11:29.180
Not bad at all...

00:11:37.060 --> 00:11:41.360
I give to you my own name!
Let your name now be Valgaav!

00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:54.170
On that day, I was reborn
as Lord Gaav's retainer!

00:11:57.550 --> 00:11:59.110
And to avenge
Lord Gaav's death...

00:11:59.490 --> 00:12:02.950
...I will kill Lina Inverse
with my own hands!

00:12:06.630 --> 00:12:07.960
Wait!

00:12:08.900 --> 00:12:10.090
Here. Take it.

00:12:16.770 --> 00:12:18.930
Almayce! What are you doing?!

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:20.110
It's him!

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:20.900
Valgaav!

00:12:23.440 --> 00:12:25.310
You're betraying me?

00:12:25.980 --> 00:12:29.250
Forgive me, but I have
no time to compromise.

00:12:29.820 --> 00:12:31.680
My time grows short.

00:12:32.690 --> 00:12:35.090
Miss Lina, I'll break the spell now!

00:12:35.590 --> 00:12:37.110
Die with the rest!

00:12:41.860 --> 00:12:48.500
Gods! Monsters! Humans!
All stand in my way!

00:12:48.570 --> 00:12:51.000
Then I shall strike
all of you down!

00:12:53.210 --> 00:12:54.830
Give me Gorun Nova!

00:12:56.010 --> 00:12:59.500
Sorry, pal, but there's no way
we're giving this to you!

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:05.050
This looks bad!
Let's get out of here!

00:13:05.120 --> 00:13:05.920
Right!

00:13:10.260 --> 00:13:12.750
Give me Gorun Nova!

00:13:14.460 --> 00:13:18.560
If you do, I promise I won't
summon Darkstar to this world!

00:13:18.630 --> 00:13:20.400
- You're kidding, right?
- What?!

00:13:20.470 --> 00:13:24.910
Sorry, but when it comes to selling
out other people to save yourself...

00:13:25.270 --> 00:13:28.500
...my policy is to stop it!

00:13:28.580 --> 00:13:30.170
And that applies...

00:13:31.310 --> 00:13:32.680
...both to this world...

00:13:36.550 --> 00:13:37.680
...and the Overworld!

00:13:38.020 --> 00:13:38.820
Miss Lina!

00:13:38.890 --> 00:13:39.650
Lina!

00:13:40.720 --> 00:13:42.090
That's right!

00:13:44.360 --> 00:13:46.330
At the very least,
theJustice we believe in...

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:48.330
...is different from yours!

00:13:50.530 --> 00:13:51.790
I agree!

00:13:51.870 --> 00:13:55.230
If you insist on doing this,
then you're now our enemies!

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:57.200
All right! You understand, Zel!

00:13:57.410 --> 00:14:00.500
Don't any of you care what
happens to this world?!

00:14:00.640 --> 00:14:01.610
Miss Lina...

00:14:01.680 --> 00:14:03.200
I'm with you all the way.

00:14:03.280 --> 00:14:04.010
Filia?!

00:14:04.250 --> 00:14:05.770
Filia! You?!

00:14:05.850 --> 00:14:07.640
Forgive me, Lord Elder!

00:14:08.480 --> 00:14:12.750
In this case, I believe Lina
and the others are correct!

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:16.680
Xellos!

00:14:16.760 --> 00:14:21.490
Oh, my! Filia, the straight-arrow,
turning against the Supreme Elder?

00:14:21.560 --> 00:14:23.090
I never saw that coming!

00:14:23.230 --> 00:14:27.830
Xellos! The detested Xellos?!
Filia! Have you?!

00:14:28.140 --> 00:14:29.860
No, I haven't!

00:14:29.940 --> 00:14:32.370
Allow me to help you, Filia!

00:14:32.870 --> 00:14:34.770
Are you trying to ruin me?!

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:40.610
Well, at the very least,
my duty is to finish off Valgaav.

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:43.010
So be it...

00:14:43.580 --> 00:14:45.180
Wh- Who's the enemy here?!

00:14:45.250 --> 00:14:47.410
Just about everyone except us!

00:14:58.230 --> 00:15:02.030
My people! Hold back!
Make no move against Xellos!

00:15:02.100 --> 00:15:06.970
If you do, we're finished!
He'll destroy us in a second!

00:15:07.270 --> 00:15:09.240
You have wisdom to
go with your old age.

00:15:10.610 --> 00:15:11.640
No, you don't!

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:15.180
Valgaav, I'll be your
opponent this time.

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:17.810
Take care of things over there!

00:15:20.960 --> 00:15:22.290
GOZU VLOW!

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:28.920
Dammit! Spells really
won't work on him!

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:29.760
What'll we do?

00:15:30.130 --> 00:15:31.460
Is this all we have left?

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:32.290
Wait!

00:15:32.630 --> 00:15:34.070
Look! You see his sword?

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:37.500
It isn't putting out its light blade!

00:15:40.110 --> 00:15:42.700
He must be afraid of
the effect it had last time.

00:15:45.180 --> 00:15:47.980
Anyway, Gourry, don't
use the Sword of Light!

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:50.020
Now wait a minute.
What am I supposed to do?

00:15:50.080 --> 00:15:52.020
All right!
Then we have a chance!

00:15:53.020 --> 00:15:54.510
If a direct attack doesn't work...

00:15:54.590 --> 00:15:55.780
LIGHTI NG!

00:15:57.760 --> 00:15:59.230
BEHFIS BRI NG!

00:16:03.760 --> 00:16:06.160
Why am I the one who has
to do this?! OW! Jeez...

00:16:06.630 --> 00:16:08.120
Use this, Gourry!

00:16:08.370 --> 00:16:09.100
Thanks!

00:16:12.840 --> 00:16:17.170
What do any of you know
of my peoples' suffering?!

00:16:21.480 --> 00:16:27.180
"Anna-ku rahzu lamku so.
Izu-pe ku naomu!"

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:28.850
Those words again!

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:30.750
I'm sure of it! That's a holy spell...

00:16:30.830 --> 00:16:33.490
...that's been lost for
the last thousand years!

00:16:33.560 --> 00:16:35.150
FLAME BREATH!

00:16:43.800 --> 00:16:46.240
"Lord of the dreams that terrify..."

00:16:46.310 --> 00:16:50.840
"Sword of cold and darkness, free
yourself from the heavens' bonds!"

00:16:50.910 --> 00:16:52.940
"Become one with my power,
one with my body..."

00:16:53.010 --> 00:16:55.040
"...and let us walk the
path of destruction together!"

00:16:55.250 --> 00:16:56.910
"Power that can smash
even the souls of the gods!"

00:16:57.280 --> 00:16:58.650
What's?!

00:16:59.650 --> 00:17:01.420
RAGNA BLADE!!!

00:17:01.990 --> 00:17:03.080
Light, come forth!

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:05.720
Th- This power!

00:17:06.090 --> 00:17:07.490
Source of all creation!

00:17:07.560 --> 00:17:10.660
Sword of Darkness with the power
of the Lord of Nightmares!

00:17:27.950 --> 00:17:28.610
Did it work?!

00:17:33.020 --> 00:17:34.490
<i>All I did was crack his armor!</i>

00:17:40.060 --> 00:17:43.790
How can this be?
No time left...

00:17:43.860 --> 00:17:46.660
I was so close to getting it!

00:17:50.640 --> 00:17:52.970
Looks like your friend's
at the end of his rope.

00:17:53.040 --> 00:17:53.970
Damn!

00:17:54.040 --> 00:17:56.240
Are you ready to accept
your defeat as well?

00:17:58.650 --> 00:18:00.410
I carry on Lord Gaav's name!

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:04.710
I won't die before
I've had my revenge!

00:18:19.400 --> 00:18:20.230
What the?!

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:24.170
An Ancient Dragon!
Is it possible?! Can he be?!

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:26.500
An Ancient Dragon?
What do you mean?

00:18:26.940 --> 00:18:30.100
Just one of them had the power
of thousands of our kind...

00:18:30.180 --> 00:18:33.700
...and because their violent
nature was so detestable to us...

00:18:33.950 --> 00:18:38.850
...the Dragon race hunted them
down and exterminated them!

00:18:50.730 --> 00:18:51.960
Hear me, golden dragon!

00:18:52.930 --> 00:18:56.700
Is that the reason you give for
why you hunted us down?

00:18:57.100 --> 00:18:58.070
YOU LI E!

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:02.040
The truth is you golden
dragons feared our power!

00:19:02.880 --> 00:19:06.180
Feared we would topple you from
your rule of the Dragon race!

00:19:06.250 --> 00:19:08.180
No... This can't be...

00:19:08.380 --> 00:19:12.680
And for that reason you hunted
us down and slaughtered us!

00:19:16.990 --> 00:19:20.290
I never thought
he was that powerful.

00:19:20.360 --> 00:19:21.330
I've been careless.

00:19:21.560 --> 00:19:26.430
You mean he has the power
of a Monster AND a dragon?!

00:19:26.500 --> 00:19:27.900
l- Is that possible?

00:19:28.040 --> 00:19:32.400
This "hateful" and "detestable"
dragon's power will destroy you all!

00:19:42.350 --> 00:19:43.840
What's happening?!

00:19:43.920 --> 00:19:46.510
Well, I can guess
what it is, but...

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:49.250
Sorry about this.

00:19:50.720 --> 00:19:54.090
Not like this...
I won't let it end like this!

00:19:59.230 --> 00:20:00.830
Where's Almayce?

00:20:03.140 --> 00:20:04.930
He's vanished.

00:20:05.610 --> 00:20:09.370
So, you're as powerful
as this, are you?

00:20:09.440 --> 00:20:13.170
Filia may have judged you well.

00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:15.180
I wonder about that.

00:20:15.250 --> 00:20:17.480
Anyway, we've come this
far on this mission.

00:20:17.550 --> 00:20:20.320
Can't just let a bunch of strangers
take over the job now, right?

00:20:20.390 --> 00:20:22.820
We'll fight them. For now, at least.

00:20:23.120 --> 00:20:24.850
I see... I see.

00:20:25.460 --> 00:20:29.190
I'm sure they'll be back
to steal the Sword of Light.

00:20:29.260 --> 00:20:32.360
No need to go looking
for a fight, huh?

00:20:32.430 --> 00:20:33.460
What a pain...

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:37.330
They're after the Sword of Light...

00:20:37.400 --> 00:20:40.100
...along with the other
weapons Darkstar created.

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:41.540
And also...

00:20:41.610 --> 00:20:44.370
Miss Lina!
Please let me come with you!

00:20:45.350 --> 00:20:47.910
I want to see for myself...

00:20:47.980 --> 00:20:50.350
...if the prophecy of
destruction is really true.

00:20:50.880 --> 00:20:54.340
And whether what Valgaav
said was true as well.

00:20:54.860 --> 00:20:56.520
Oh, Filia...

00:20:56.590 --> 00:21:00.490
The journey ahead of
you will be hard indeed.

00:22:23.640 --> 00:22:25.540
So, we're off to find
the last weapon, and...

00:22:25.810 --> 00:22:26.800
What are you doing?

00:22:26.880 --> 00:22:28.940
A... A WAR?!

00:22:29.020 --> 00:22:31.850
Next time, " Continuous Fire!
The Wind Swept Shore of Battle!"

00:22:31.920 --> 00:22:34.250
You better watch, or I'll
REALLY cause some trouble!
